DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
29777::$$$message_0215_0000_0000$$$::The day is over.[lr]::
29778::$$$message_0215_0000_0001$$$::I lie down, splay out my arms and legs, and let the fatigue overcome my body.[lr]::
29779::$$$message_0215_0000_0002$$$::My mind sinks into the calming numbness of sleep.[lr]::
29780::$$$message_0215_0000_0003$$$::"...Haah."[lr]::
29781::$$$message_0215_0000_0004$$$::   I feel so free.[lr]::
29782::$$$message_0215_0000_0005$$$::It's a bad omen, so I can't trust the break in my consciousness.::
29783::$$$message_0215_0001_0000$$$::Sleep is a rite of passage to end one day and begin the next.[lr]::
29784::$$$message_0215_0001_0001$$$::Everyone returns to the hollow of memory.[lr]::
29785::$$$message_0215_0001_0002$$$::I sink and relax into the abyss.::
29786::$$$message_0215_0002_0000$$$::"Now, what to do tomorrow..."[lr]::
29787::$$$message_0215_0002_0001$$$::There's a lot to think about and do, but I can decide tomorrow.[lr]::
29788::$$$message_0215_0002_0002$$$::For now, I commend myself on a good day's work...::

